   "image": "books/G1/099/p04.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 549,
   "text": "In the Garden The flowers bloom on a warm summer day. You can hear the sound of bees in the garden. Buzz, buzz, buzz. L ittle honeybees f ly a round the f lowers. These bees are working!",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    6.39,
    20.12
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "image": "books/G1/099/p05.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 549,
   "text": "Something sweet is inside t he f lowers. It is called nectar.",
   "textBox": [
    0.0513,
    0.1066,
    0.2864,
    0.2762
   ],
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    21.21,
